      "html": "<h1>Two leaders, one term</h1>\n<p>A follower that hears nothing starts an election.</p>\n<pre class=\"md-code\"><code><span class=\"tok-storage tok-type\">int</span> term <span class=\"tok-keyword tok-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-constant tok-numeric\">1</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation tok-terminator\">;</span></code></pre>",
